SY Car Data (sy_cardash) is a re-skin of Car Data (iteriodev_cardash) by IterioDev: the renderer (screens.json,
tele-widgets.js, the M Track elements, the backdrop and the Turkish translation layer) is changed, src/ is the
original app. It contains code ported from cauliflowermossgrape/idrive7-apps
(https://github.com/cauliflowermossgrape/idrive7-apps @ c67ea17), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 cauliflowermossgrape.
The license text is LICENSE in this folder. The ported files, in the package's src/:

  trips.js                      from apps/live_data/trips.js, signals.js, main.js
  engine-groups.js              from apps/live_data/useful.js, kit/runtime/sgbd.js
  engine-groups-catalog.js      from apps/live_data/useful.js, builtin/DME8FF_R.json
  transmission.js               from apps/zf8hp/reader.js, egs.js, catalog.js
  main.js                       the engine types of kit/runtime/engine.js (ENGINE_TYPES)

Each names its source at its top. The rest of Car Data is under the license of the IterioDev/car-apps repository
(LICENSE.md there): PolyForm Strict 1.0.0 - personal use only, no redistribution.